val is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  27 MAY 03 at 10 45     HER 2 Addendum     RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block C   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Not Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 to chromosome 17 signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  30 MAY 03 at 12 46 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right sentinel node count 375  are two separate lymph node fragments measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  with attached fat  The fat is partially removed and the two lymph nodes are entirely frozen as Fx 1  now as A  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast lumpectomy  is an oriented  1 suture medial  two sutures inferior  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm fibrofatty breast tissue with an overlying REMOVED_DATE x 2 9cm tan previously blue dyed skin ellipse  The specimen is inked  posterior black  lateral yellow  medial green  and serially sectioned displaying a fairly well  circumscribed tan pink REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 8cm mass which comes to 0 6cm REMOVED_DATE  1 1cm  2 0cm  3 0cm  and 3 2cm from the skin  anterior   posterior  medial  lateral  inferior  and superior margins respectively  The remaining tissue is tan yellow fibrofatty breast tissue  There are no other masses or lesions grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   B  Mass to posterior margin  C  Mass to overlying sk