 and focally come to 0 1cm from the deep margin and 0 4cm from the anterior margin  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE  A  Main mass to anterior margin  B  Main mass to posterior margin  C  Irregular extension of main mass to posterior margin  D  Representative sections of main mass  E  Representative sections of second nodule  F  Closest posterior margin to second nodule  G  Discrete small nodule to posterior margin  H  Discrete small nodule to anterior inferior margin  I J  Representative sections of fibrous parenchyma away from masses  with ink representing posterior  Within the axillary fat multiple tan lymph nodes are identified  ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 2 0cm in greatest dimension  Whole nodes are submitted in K N  and representative sections of nodes are submitted in O Q  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  additional nodal tissue   are 3 tan nodules  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  The larger nodule is bisected and submitted entirely in R  and the smaller nodules are submitted entirely in S  Resident  MELINDA J  FAN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODES   ADDITIONAL     report_end  , Checked.
